Subject: [PATCH] cheeseburger: modem W2 part 2: SMP2P out, MPSS load + auth,
 SMP2P watch (steps 7-10)

sweet_mpss.c: outbound SMP2P item 428 under TCSR mutex 3, modem.mdt metadata auth, modem.bNN segments via unmappable 1 MiB windows, AUTH_COMPLETE, inbound 435 negotiation/SSR ack/ready, clean stop. sweet_mss.c: Linux-style ownership masks, shared header, steps 1-10.
---
